      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "South of town, a 62‑acre man‑made lake called Crawford Creek offers camping, boating, fishing, and a swimming beach.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
