      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every July 3‑5, Battle Creek hosts a Fourth of July parade, fireworks, a fireman’s dance, and even a frog‑jumping contest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
