      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_Creek%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Battle Creek sits on the Maple River, a tributary that flows through Ida County.",
